  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narrativa gerada: ValueSet BRCondicaoAmostra</b></p><a name=\"BRCondicaoAmostra\"> </a><a name=\"hcBRCondicaoAmostra\"> </a><p>Este conjunto de valores inclui códigos baseados nas seguintes regras:</p><ul><li>Incluir estes códigos, tal como definidos em <a href=\"CodeSystem-BRCondicaoAmostra.html\"><code>https://terminologia.saude.gov.br/fhir/CodeSystem/BRCondicaoAmostra</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> versão Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Código</b></td><td><b>Ecrã</b></td></tr><tr><td>QUE</td><td>Recipiente quebrado</td></tr><tr><td>TEC</td><td>Incidente técnico</td></tr><tr><td>CIN</td><td>Coleta inadequada da amostra</td></tr><tr><td>INS</td><td>Amostra insuficiente</td></tr><tr><td>INC</td><td>Cadastro incorreto da amostra</td></tr><tr><td>IMP</td><td>Amostra imprópria para análise solicitada.</td></tr><tr><td>NCI</td><td>Amostra não correpondente à identificada</td></tr><tr><td>FPC</td><td>Amostra fora do prazo de coleta</td></tr><tr><td>SID</td><td>Amostra sem identificação</td></tr><tr><td>ILE</td><td>Amostra com identificação ilegível</td></tr><tr><td>INA</td><td>Amostra com identificação inadequada</td></tr><tr><td>VAZ</td><td>Amostra vazada</td></tr></table></li><li>Incluir estes códigos, tal como definidos em <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0493</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 2.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> versão ?2.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Código</b></td><td><b>Ecrã</b></td><td><b>Definição</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-CON\">CON</a></td><td>Contaminated</td><td>Contaminated</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-LIVE\">LIVE</a></td><td>Live</td><td>Live</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-HEM\">HEM</a></td><td>Hemolyzed</td><td>Hemolyzed</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-FROZ\">FROZ</a></td><td>Frozen</td><td>Frozen</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-CFU\">CFU</a></td><td>Centrifuged</td><td>Centrifuged</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-AUT\">AUT</a></td><td>Autolyzed</td><td>Autolyzed</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-CLOT\">CLOT</a></td><td>Clotted</td><td>Clotted</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-ROOM\">ROOM</a></td><td>Room temperature</td><td>Room temperature</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-SNR\">SNR</a></td><td>Sample not received</td><td>Sample not received</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/5.5.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html#v2-0493-COOL\">COOL</a></td><td>Cool</td><td>Cool</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
